<title>JAPAN: NKK lowers 96/97 parent current profit forecast.</title>
<headline>NKK lowers 96/97 parent current profit forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>NKK Corp said on Wednesday that it had lowered its forecast for parent current profit in the year to March 31, 1997 to 40 billion yen from its May forecast of 45 billion yen.</p>
<p>Details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
